/* ---- The progress pictures deck (17 Oct, Alex): a swipe of big 3:4 cards, one per angle, the next peeking in; a photo fills its card, an empty angle is a dashed card with the camera and its name. The number and name on a glass chip at the top, the state and action at the foot. Dots under it, filled once an angle has its photo. */
.ppd { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin: 12px -20px 4px; }
.ppd-scroller { display: flex; gap: 12px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 2px 20px; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scroll-padding: 0 20px; scrollbar-width: none; overscroll-behavior-x: contain; }
